<a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/apple-sports/id6446788829">Apple Sports</a> was updated today with support for the UFC, allowing mixed martial arts (MMA) fans to keep track of fights in the free iPhone app.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/apple-sports-ufc-screenshots.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1077179" /><br/>
The latest version of the Apple Sports app provides live, real-time stats for UFC fights. The app displays full cards of men's and women's fights, round-by-round updates, a heat map of strikes during fights, and more.<br/>
<br/>
The app also gained support for three more soccer leagues today: China's Super League, Russia's Premier League, and Sweden's Allsvenskan.<br/>
<br/>
